/P 122 0 R
/E (The YBX3 series is an optimized design based on YB3 high-voltage flameproof three-phase induction motors. Motor losses are further reduced, and efficiency meets the Grade 2 energy-efficiency requirements of GB 30254-2013. The series features a compact structure, light weight, high efficiency, energy savings, low noise and vibration, high reliability, long service life, and convenient installation and maintenance.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [25]
>>
