208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (By reducing installation space and motor dimensions, the YBX3 series achieves compact construction while maintaining higher performance and reliability. The optimized high-voltage flameproof three-phase induction motor meets these requirements with dependable operation.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
209 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
