/Title (Bearings are available in rolling-bearing and sleeve-bearing configurations. Rolling bearings are generally used; sleeve bearings are selected when operating conditions, such as speed, load capacity or duty requirements, exceed the applicable limits. Standard-design H500-2 \(6 kV, 10 kV\), H560-2 \(6 kV, 10 kV\) and H630-2 \(6 kV, 10 kV\) motors use sleeve bearings with forced lubrication; H500-2 may also be configured with self-lubricating sleeve bearings. Other motors use rolling bearings with continuous oil filling and draining arrangements.)
